BASE='''Use case: illustration-story. Full-width SINGLE illustration; reference strip only supplies architecture and identities, never reproduce the strip or multiple panels. Immersive subjective psychological horror in an ordinary Chinese mall. Viewer IS Chen32: show NO Chen face, head, back, body or third-person portrait; only TWO young hands and NAVY cuffs at bottom of frame. Zhou43 is the ONLY visible person, middle-aged exactly43, short buzzcut with sparse grey temples, recognizably same broad face and LEFT eyebrow mole. CHARCOAL jacket, OLIVE shirt. Not elderly, no beard. White oval plate holds a SMALL modest pile of tightly curled pink RAW FROZEN BEEF, visibly white frost, NO steam, no huge mountain or whole steak. Oppressive enclosure, severe flat angular cel shadows but readable eyes/hands/evidence, no black void. No smiling, no melodramatic open-mouthed shout: silent fixation and jaw tension, as if afraid viewer will vanish again. No monster, no added apparition or magical light. Worn Chinese mall service counter with chipped corner, grey landline, single weak warm desk lamp; pharmacy shelves behind with only abstract plain packages no readable markings. Familiar chipped dark stone escalator plinth and scratched railing glimpsed at side, SAME mall layout, ordinary service area not an abandoned ruin. Two characters in story only, only Zhou face visible.'''
