('B','引入第1段','第一视角·不肯放手', '''Subjective close eye-level viewpoint. Viewer supports one modest frozen-beef plate from below with young LEFT hand at bottom-left. Viewer young RIGHT hand at bottom-right holds the rim, navy cuff pulled back slightly. Zhou reaches with his RIGHT hand from upper-left, fingers encircle viewer's RIGHT WRIST; anatomically clear grip at wrist, not handholding. Zhou's LEFT palm braces far desk edge, making exactly FOUR hands total with separate origins. Plate slightly tilted but frozen curls stay stuck together. Zhou's face very close upper center-right, staring DIRECTLY into viewer's eyes with restrained desperate terror, clenched jaw and strained wet eyes; he blocks retreat into the narrow passage. No attack or aggression, fear of losing friend. Cropped chair back and desk corner crowd the frame. Meat stays small, wrist grip and direct eye contact dominate.'''),
